#18200
Immortal Map Room for the City of Kir-Oshi~
   This room is surrounded by total blackness on all sides. It serves as the
immortal entryway into the city of Kir-Oshi. There is an old sign hovering in
the northingness. Right next to it, a shiny new map mystically moves about.
Some words, probably serving as the legend to the new map are under it.
A large Ironwood desk mysteriously floats in the center of this void-like
cavern. Scattered upon its surface, scrolls of ancient parchment are filled
with hand-written scrawlings. The only exit leads down, to the main gate of
Kir-Oshi.
~
