legend~
0~
B = Baker
T = Temple
D = Donation Room
I = Inside
C = City
F = Flower Shop
TV = Tavern
1 = Overlaps (Weaponsmith, Chosen Board Room, which leads up)
2 = Overlaps (Bank, General Store)
TR = The Trade Board Room
A = Armor shop
3 = Overlaps (Citizenship "shop", Sushi Shop)
4 = Overlaps (Stables, Post Office) .. JL = Jail (which leads up)
DM = Dump 
G = Garden
ID = Identify Shop
TA = Tattoo Shop
~
