scrawlings~
0~
Updates/Changes:
   a) Main entrance to Oshi to the north, harbors to east (connects to
      ocean), temple to west, gardens to south.
   b) Added ID shop, Jail, Dump, Chosen/Trade board rooms, mortician,
      stables, general store
   c) Need key to access room above the tavern, allowing players to fight
      the mobs that used to be located in the "Fire Dragon Inn"
   d) Changed harbor so it doesn't overlap, 3 piers instead of 5, with
      small ships docked, the 3rd of which opens to a tunnel connecting to
      the Lui'she Ch'uan Tong hideout
~
