#18201
The Altar~
   This room is almost completely filled by a huge altar that has been
constructed to worship the Gods. You can tell that this place is well-
respected because pilgrims have left money and other offerings here
without fear that thieves will take them. There is a mosaic behind
the altar, constructed centuries ago by the monks.
~
