#18202
A Meditation Room~
   This room is simple and unadorned, except for a few colored lanterns that
hang from the ceiling. The floor is bare stone, with straw mats placed from
one end to the other. The purpose of this room is clear: to facilitate the
ancient art of Zanzen, the meditation.
~
