#18205
The Northwest Guard Tower~
   You stand within the northwestern tower of the protective wall around
Kir-Oshi. An open window lies to the north, allowing you to see the glorious
dor-Sefrith plains. Several small wooden chairs line the tower, and leather
bound books have been strewn haphazardly on the floor. From here, you can
proceed east along the northern face of the wall, south along the western
face, or down a bamboo ladder onto the ground level of the town.
