#18326
An Aquatic Tunnel~
   Running your hands over the rusty metal surface, groping your way along
this channel, you feel a sharp pain in your left palm as ocean coral tears
your flesh. Closing your hand tightly to cover the wound, you press onward,
hurrying out of - or maybe into - this dangerous place, with blood coloring
the icy waters.
