#18329
An Aquatic Tunnel~
   The tunnel widens slightly here, and the end of a ladder's rungs can be
glimpsed above you. There is an endless assault of aquatic life here, and the
sight of light from above instills a desparate urge to break free of this
claustrophobic tunnel. There is coral and algae growing half-luminescently on
the iron framework of the tunnel, and it increases steadily below.
~
